  partName: Blade24
  description: The Blade25 is a thin, flat component positioned at the middle-center-front
    of the jet engine, constructed from Blades2 material, responsible for further
    compressing air and enhancing engine efficiency. Its compact size and strategic
    placement enable the engine to achieve optimal performance. Notably, the Blade25
    is carefully angled to minimize air resistance and maximize airflow, contributing
    to the engine's remarkable power-to-weight ratio.
